---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: How the pictures are made
    accDescr: scripts/screenshots.sh builds the extension and starts the pinned Playwright image with the repository read-only. Inside, run.sh installs the Inter font and the tools, and capture.py opens the stage in Chromium. The stage shows the real popup or switcher of the extension in a frame, with a stand-in for Chrome and made-up accounts; every file comes from the repository and no request leaves the browser. capture.py takes each picture at a fixed size, scale, scheme and language and writes the GIF, and the pictures leave the container as an archive, into docs/images and store/images. After a change of main, every release and every week, the screenshot bot runs the script and opens a pull request with the pictures whose pixels changed.

    bot["The screenshot bot<br>after a change of main, every release and every week"]
    script["scripts/screenshots.sh<br>builds extension/lib from src/"]
    bot --> script

    subgraph image ["The pinned Playwright image, the repository read-only"]
        direction TB
        run["test/harness/run.sh<br>the Inter font, Playwright and Pillow"]
        capture["test/harness/capture.py<br>each picture at a fixed size, scale,<br>scheme and language"]
        run --> capture
        subgraph browser ["Chromium, with no network"]
            direction TB
            stage["stage.html<br>the backdrop and the text of the store"]
            stub["chrome-stub.js<br>the texts of _locales and made-up accounts"]
            pages["The real popup.html and switcher.html<br>with players.js and lib/"]
            stage --> pages
            stub --> pages
        end
        capture --> stage
    end

    script --> run
    pages --> pictures["docs/images: switch.gif, manage.png, switcher.png<br>store/images: screenshots and promo tiles<br>in English and German"]
    pictures --> pull["The bot's pull request with the pictures<br>whose pixels changed"]

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class bot bot
    class pictures,pull done
